ory":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record in Wise County runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those 75 years. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 46% of normal in February to March and 161% in April to May. Grid 15730 had its driest year in 2005, at 47% of normal.</p>"}
